OL,3,AHealey delivered 'scattergun' Budget
OL,4,Athat failed to tackle UK's challenges,
OL,5,Athink tank says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the pre-recorded interview, he also
OL,8,Fsays there "will be a reduction in the
OL,9,Fbenefits bill" before the next general
OL,10,Felection - yesterday the Conservatives
OL,11,Faccused Labour of being "addicted to
OL,12,Fwelfare"
OL,14,FIn his Budget, the chancellor included
OL,15,Fa #100 energy payment for 20 million
OL,16,Fhouseholds in England and tax rises on
OL,17,Fsome savings and rental profits - a
OL,18,Fquick guide to the policy announcements
